the <a>:
     - ten: the dieu huong
     - attribute:
              href: gan link muon dieu huong toi( back link )
     - co the dung the nay de lien ket voi cac file bang cach gan ten file vao trong thuoc tinh href
     - exp: <a href="https://www.youtube.com/">vao day</a> --> bam chu "vao day" se chuyen sang ytb
the <hr>:
     tac dung: gach ngang

the <ul>&<li> <ol>&<li>:
     tac dung: tao danh sach
      cap the ul va li: danh dau cham
      cap the ol va li: danh dau so